{title: Khel Mandala}
{artist: Ajay Atul}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Tujhya paayarishi kuni,        [Dm] saan thor [E] nahai
[A] Saad sunya kaaljachi,        [Dm] tujhya kaani [A] jaai
Hey.. [A] Tari deva sara na hyo,        [Dm] bhog kasha [E] pai
[A] Haravali waat disha,        [Dm] andharalya [E] dhaai
[A] Bavaaloon udhalato,        [Dm] jeev maaya [A] baapaa
[A] Vanvaayo [Dm] oori pet [F] la,        Khel [A] Mandala [F]
Khel [A] Mandala [F],        Khel [A] Mandala [F] Deva
Khel [A] Mandala [F],        [A] Sandaliga reetbhat
[F] ghetla vasa tujha,        [A] Tuch vaat dakhiv ga
[F] khel mandala,        [A] Daavi deva pail paar
[F] paathishi tu raha ubha,        [A] Yo tujhyach umbaryat
[F] khel mandala,        Ha [A] Usavala ganagot [G] saara,
Aa [F] dhar kunacha [A] nhai,        [A] Bhegaalalya bhooi pari [G] jeena
an [F] gaar jeevala [A] jaali,        [E] Bala de [F] zhunjaayala
[A] kirpechi [E] dhaal de,        [E] Inaveeti [F] pancha praan,
[A] jeevarhat taal [E] de,        [A] Karapala raan deva,
[A] Jalala shivaar,        [A] tari nhai dheer sanda [F] la?
Khel [A] Mandala [F],        Khel [A] Mandala [F]
Khel [A] Mandala [F] Deva,        Khel [A] Mandala [F]
